<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom rises 2.49 percent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom rises 2.49 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunication Company Ltd (PTCL) 10-rupee stock rose 0.60 rupee, or 2.49 percent, to 24.70 at the Karachi Stock Exchange on Sunday after its GDR (global depositary receipt) closed higher abroad, dealers said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Some 0.8 million shares changed hands in early trade, one dealer said.</p>
<p>The scrip was likely to gain further before the close, the dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
